		<title type="html"><![CDATA[qdmr linux cps working with 20240908]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5163&amp;p=37394#p37394"><![CDATA[
hiya kids!<br><br>Good News!!  qdmr program is now working good with opengd77 20240908.  this is a linux qt6 program that can read and write codeplug to opengd77.  the developer is a Fine Business Operator and qdmr works good.  Satellite kepler update is working now too.  You can edit the satellite list directly in qdmr.<br><br>the git repo is at <a href="https://github.com/hmatuschek/qdmr" class="postlink">https://github.com/hmatuschek/qdmr</a><br><br>i have tested the "devel" branch is working good on debian12 with md9600 and uv390 radios with 20240908 opengd firmware.<br><br>i can not say how happy i am to not have to use windoze vm with opengd.   <br><br>i have not tried the databse update yet.<br><br>YMMV.<br><br>--gaspo.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=403">AF6MQ</a> — Sat Jun 07, 2025 12:31 am</p><hr />
